stion\nSAS au capital de 1000 € - RCS: EVRY n° 907 631 170\nSiège social: 2 rue Charles Drezet 91100 CORBEIL-ESSONNES\nN° TVA Intra-communautaire: FR23907631170\nCarte professionnelle Gestion n° CPI 9101 2022 0000000 14 (CCI Evry)\nNuméro Orias n° 23006870\n\nAssurance RC Pro: SERENIS ASSURANCES SA n° VD 7.000.001/000408/22528\nGarantie financière: QBE Insurance (400 000 €)\nMédiateur à la consommation : MEDIMMOCONSO - contact@medimmoconso.fr", "tronque": false, "monday_post_id": 4894115610, "parent_post_id": null}, {"monday_id": 11183841055, "auteur": "Marion Brenot", "le": "2026-02-11T12:45:12.000Z", "contenu": "relance lorenove\n\nhttps://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#sent/CqMvqmcpdhVSqKRsqLKTsrzvCzVrZwdfpXDnJjkVFtSGQVNWCHFvTxntJNJHT...", "tronque": false, "monday_post_id": 4915521170, "parent_post_id": null}, {"monday_id": 11183841055, "auteur": "Marion Brenot", "le": "2026-03-09T15:04:55.000Z", "contenu": "relance lorenove\n\nhttps://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#sent/lLtBPchXLkBpQsplrKtdzcLXPBxFVcxCjWRCSJxJbkTWjNCGFRtgMmsVRxGqV...", "tronque": false, "monday_post_id": 4991347734, "parent_post_id": null}, {"monday_id": 11183841055, "auteur": "Marion Brenot", "le": "2026-03-13T07:48:29.000Z", "contenu": "reception devis lorenove\n\ndevis-34459-2-rue-joachim-du-bellay-91250-st-germain-les-corbeil (1).pdf\n\n\n\nje demande un comparatif à wilock\n\nhttps://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#sent/DmwnWtMqhrThqRxMPJQWzVWrCWHKKtSnLTtjnkKdFWWvmfGhgdvxnhgqLzVCP...", "tronque": false, "monday_post_id": 5006885627, "parent_post_id": null}, {"monday_id": 11183841055, "auteur": "Marion Brenot", "le": "2026-03-13T11:41:04.000Z", "contenu": "je demande un comparatif à easymatik\n\nhttps://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#sent/DmwnWtMqhrThqRxMPJQWzVWrCWHKKtSnLTtjnkKdFWWvmfGhsZCzzPnggltbz...\n\nreception devis\n\nhttps://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#inbox/WhctKLbvXbwhckxdwRlZJJgpRmfRDxQFsKjxZWkXxpvdvHmMbZdddzNqQZvc...\n\ndevis-26031305480sg-2-rue-joachim-du-bellay-91250-st-germain-les-corbeil.pdf", "tro